<title>ITALY: Italy's Snamprogetti wins Abu Dhabi contracts.</title>
<headline>Italy's Snamprogetti wins Abu Dhabi contracts.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Snamprogetti, part of Italian energy group ENI, said it has been awarded two contracts in Abu Dhabi by the Abu Dhabi National Oil Company (Adnoc).</p>
<p>Snamprogetti said in a statement the value of the two contracts was &quot;several hundred million dollars&quot;.</p>
<p>The company will build condensate treatment plants at al-Ruwais and a plant for the production of condensates at the al-Asab gas field.</p>
<p>Both projects will be completed in 30 months.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +392 66129589</p>
